sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant CI as "CI/CD"
    participant IAA as AI_Orchestrator
    participant EKS as EKS_ControlPlane
    participant Agent as MicroAgent_Pod
    participant MCP as MCP_Server
    participant DI as DataInterface
    participant MS as MemoryStore
    participant GAL as AuditTrail
    participant ET as ExternalTools

    User->>CI: Push agent code and config
    CI->>CI: Build image and run tests
    CI->>EKS: Deploy image - create or update Deployment
    EKS->>IAA: Notify new or updated deployment
    IAA->>EKS: Schedule rollout to target namespace
    EKS->>Agent: Pull image and start pod
    Agent->>DI: Fetch configuration and credentials
    Agent->>MS: Load session state if exists
    Agent->>DI: Retrieve evidence and input data
    Agent->>Agent: Initialize runtime and models
    Agent->>MCP: Request tool access via server client
    MCP-->>Agent: Provide tool endpoints and tokens
    Agent->>ET: Invoke external tool via MCP if needed
    ET-->>Agent: Return tool results
    Agent->>Agent: Process data and generate findings
    Agent->>MS: Persist session memory and state
    Agent->>GAL: Log interactions and audit events
    Agent->>IAA: Emit telemetry and health metrics
    IAA->>EKS: Autoscale or replicate agent pods if required
    User->>Agent: Trigger on demand run or review results
    Agent-->>User: Return results and UI payload
    Agent->>EKS: Graceful shutdown or redeploy on update
    EKS->>CI: Archive logs and artifacts optional